OL,3,GNEWSAFerries cancelled and disrupted as
OL,4,Astrong gales and rain hit Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than a dozen ferry routes were
OL,7,Fcancelled as strong gales and heavy
OL,8,Frain hit Scotland.
OL,10,FA Met Office yellow warning covered
OL,11,Fparts of the Highlands and Western
OL,12,FIsles until 19:00 with the risk of
OL,13,Fgusts touching 70mph (113km/h) in
OL,14,Fplaces. Gusts of 109mph (175km/h) were
OL,15,Frecorded near Applecross.
OL,17,FHeavy rain is also expected across
OL,18,FScotland as the remnants of Hurricane
OL,19,FIsais hit parts of the UK.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
