OL,3,GNEWSAFerries cancelled and disrupted as
OL,4,Astrong gales and rain hit Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll remaining routes on CalMac's west
OL,7,Fcoast ferry network were warned to
OL,8,Fexpect disruption or cancellation at
OL,9,Fshort notice.
